{
  "title": { "zh": "同一个 ?A 出现两次" },
  "adds": ["uEliminate", "uDecompose", "uDelete", "uConflict"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<part-ref to=\"lemma:merge\"></part-ref>的前提是 ?A → (?A → ?B)：?A 出现两次，两处必须是同一句。拆开后有两个关于 ?A 的等式。新元件「消元」：找到 ?A ≐ t，把其余等式里的 ?A 都换成 t。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-twice",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "unify",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "等式" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "eqs": ["?A → ?A ≐ Rain → Rain"] },
        { "eqs": ["?A ∧ ?A ≐ Rain ∧ Wind"] },
        { "eqs": ["?A → (?B → ?A) ≐ Rain → (Wind → Rain)"] },
        { "eqs": ["(?A → ?B) → (?A → ?B) ≐ (Rain → Wet) → (Rain → Slip)"] }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手：把每组等式解到底；对不上的，说「失败」。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "?A 确定以后，把别处的 ?A 也换掉，再看剩下的是否对得上。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "r = repeat(in, body: c3) {",
        "  body {",
        "    c0 = uDecompose(r.body)",
        "    c1 = uEliminate(c0)",
        "    c2 = uDelete(c1)",
        "    c3 = uConflict(c2)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
